Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:11.28,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,1)\fs16\fnTrebuchet MS\frz14.78\c&HF2FBF9&\3c&HB9E0AE&\pos(509,248)}BUS DAY\N PASS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.80,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Day two of the class trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:11.28,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(516,168.4)\c&H6825A1&}DAY 2 GROUP ACTIVITIES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:11.28,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left; top line,0,0,0,,{\fs32\an8\pos(512.8,10)\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&H8967B4&\c&HCDFFFF&}TRIP {\c&HE38FF5&}GUI{\c&H3C4FF0&}DE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.52,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Group activities!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:15.16,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Weren't the fall leaves \Nand the gardens pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:17.54,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,The fall colors were nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.68,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,but the timing didn't work out, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.49,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? T-Timing for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:23.42,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, you're pretending you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:26.04,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,We're going the same places as him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:27.67,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H65FDB1&\3c&HAB9031&\pos(348.8,150.8)}"HIM"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:27.72,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, no, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:31.30,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It was just a "maybe we might \Nsee each other."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:35.29,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Being able to take beautiful photos \Nis enough to make me than happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:38.56,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Truthfully, I was just a little hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:43.27,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You know, instead of going "it would be \Nnice if we saw each other,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:45.84,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,you could just set a time \Nand place to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:46.62,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:49.97,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Be alone with him somewhere \Nother than school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:52.32,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I could never.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:57.51,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, but... Hon-chan, leaving you \Nalone so suddenly would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:02.62,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Huh? That's your reason? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.52,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That was an underhanded excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:07.96,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,All right. You're forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:11.38,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,I hate people who are evasive about \Ntheir true feelings, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:13.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(516,36.4)\c&HBC83F1&\3c&H6F2296&}FWIP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:13.48,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:16.92,Default,group 8; boy A,0,0,0,,Hey, girls! What are \Nyou two talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.05,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:17.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC2FCF9&\3c&H9CA10E&\bord3\fs32\frz306.3\pos(152,157.2)\fad(1,435)}SMOOTH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:19.78,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Huh? She lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:20.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(356,1)\fs20\frz22.71\pos(72.8,98.8)\c&HAF42EB&}IT HELPS\NME OUT,\NTHOUGH...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:38.20,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an8\pos(320,98)}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(317.6,170.8)\fs16\c&H6B999E&\3c&H447387&}LOVE\NFORTUNE\NTELLING\NSTONE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:58.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The stones say if your love is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:02:59.90,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,My, how lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:03.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you close your eyes and manage \Nto walk from one stone to the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.57,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,your love will be fulfilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.04,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.79,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Still, it'd be too cringe to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.28,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Me, me! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.03,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:18.71,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,You can do it, Yamada Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:20.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:22.24,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yamada Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.93,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,Yamada's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:24.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:25.51,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:26.40,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Reft!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.28,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Which way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:30.25,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,Nice fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.89,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I'm happy your love will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:34.95,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Morimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:37.30,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What are you doing? \NDon't get in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.20,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:42.11,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,I'm way bigger than the stone, so the \Neffectiveness should be greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:43.32,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What logic is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.72,Default,group 8; boy A,0,0,0,,Hey! I see a bunch of \Nour uniforms over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.86,Default,group 8; boy A,0,0,0,,Is that group 7?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:56.92,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Try talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:57.74,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.35,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No, he's with his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:02.36,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I might be interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:07.10,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Well, if you're all right with that, \Nthen I guess it's fine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:09.60,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Okay! Look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; middle and left,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H8B3CE7&\\move(308,39,432,39)}PESTER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; middle and left,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H8733EA&\move(6,108,130,108)}PESTER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; right top/bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&HA500E3&\move(576,33,700,33)}CHATTER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; right top/bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&H8FC00F&\move(575,206,699,206)}CHATTER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; right top/bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&HA10060&\move(-19,33,105,33)}CHATTER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; second left/right,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H73FFC7&\3c&H76A43A&\move(149,34,273,34)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:21.74,Basic Sign,SIGN; second left/right,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H84FFF8&\3c&H671B65&\move(442,40,566,40)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.22,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Stop that, Tani. Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:13.47,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,Why make a face \Nlike that for the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:15.74,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Come on! Look this way! Smile! Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:16.85,Default,Mini,0,0,0,,Are we little kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:18.79,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Suzuki, your face is tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.46,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Suzuki! Your face is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,My face is weird?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:25.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Your feelings showed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:27.04,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:31.52,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,Going on your class trip with \Na girlfriend must be nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.56,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:37.50,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Even if I had one, I'd never \Nwant to be that open about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:38.88,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H2942E5&\pos(372,183)\fad(226,1)}LOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:42.06,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,I just bought an charm, \Nso I have high hopes for future me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.55,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! Hey, that's no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.01,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And after you got in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:47.73,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's a charm that—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.03,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:58.20,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, um, I'm sorry for interrupting \Nso suddenly. I saw you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.53,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\c&H80EDFA&\3c&H5257CB&\pos(122.4,49.2)}GIGGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.53,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs28\c&H80EDFA&\3c&H5257CB&\pos(300.8,46)}GIGGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:07.56,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I... thought I'd try \Nspeaking to you. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.18,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Voom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:13.17,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H2A83EC&\bord1\move(153,267,245,267,1,483)}SUCKING THE\NCHARM POWER OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.53,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,Huh? What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:16.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! It's Nissan! \NLet's get a photo together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:21.08,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's a nice view, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:22.50,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What brought that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:28.85,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fnArial\b0\bord1\fs20\pos(204,61.2)\frz17.02}YAMADA, NISHI, HONDA (3)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:28.85,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:31.60,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun sent the \Npictures from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:35.50,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Wow. So many photos of \Na bizarre group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.18,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:40.98,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,If not for the class trip energy, \Nwe probably wouldn't have taken these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.51,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Honestly, you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.30,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You should've posed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:49.99,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:52.37,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Could we take one with just us two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:57.00,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,With all those people \Naround, I just couldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:06:01.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Just going up and talking to him used up \Nall my emotional strength for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:03.38,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You did work hard for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:03.38,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H5B05E7&\fs20\frz14.52\pos(532.8,90.8)}INCREDIBLE,\NNISSHI!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:05.01,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,And actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:10.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H57FFFB&\3c&H4844D6&\fs20\frz17\move(324,249,324,403)}GOOD!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:12.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs16\frz17\move(297,194,297,351)}PICS FROM EARLIER
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.80,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada's got problems \Nwithout including me.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.94,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,He should've texted Nisshi privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:13.27,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fnArial\b0\bord1\fs16\frz17\move(220,-31,220,60)}YAMADA, NISHI, HONDA (3)
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.10,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Moron. Incompetent.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.10,0:06:12.70,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Wasn't this a chance to contact her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:17.47,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, he texted again. \NI wonder if it's a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:23.78,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,What kind of photo is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fnArial\b0\bord1\fs20\pos(185.6,64.4)}YAMADA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HD0B06E&\fnArial\b0\bord1\fs20\pos(322.4,110.8)}UNREAD MESSAGES BELOW
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fnArial\b0\bord1\fs16\pos(240,268.4)}CAN YOU LEAVE\NYOUR ROOM RIGHT NOW?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:30.33,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? He... \NHe's asking me directly. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.80,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,When is "right now"? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:36.54,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Go, Nisshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:39.27,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? But, Hon-chan, \NI'd be leaving you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:42.50,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,There's a livestream I want to watch, \Nso I won't be bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.55,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.55,Default,classmates,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:48.43,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\b0\fs16\pos(313.2,284.4)}I'M IN THE LOBBY\NIN A PLACE WITH LOTS OF CHAIRS.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:52.37,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,People are wandering around the \Nhotel a lot more than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.61,Default - Top,girl,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:55.45,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,There's Yamada-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:57.34,Default - Top,girl; background; adlib,0,0,0,,Hiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:59.33,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, some girls \NI don't know have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.80,Default - Top,Yamda; background; adlib,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.19,Default - Top,girl; background; adlib,0,0,0,,Did you go where you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:01.33,Default - Top,Yamada; background; adlib,0,0,0,,Yeah, we went everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:05.28,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Wait. Does this mean that it's possible \NI wasn't the only one he called out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:06.54,Default - Top,girls,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:08.00,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:07.67,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.46,Default - Top,Watanabe; background,0,0,0,,Yoohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:09.95,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,But now here's someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.70,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I've only seen \Nthat greeting done overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:18.35,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Actually, I feel like \NYamada-kun is with girls a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.00,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.91,0:07:25.21,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,For some reason, I've naturally thought of \Nall of Yamada-kun's actions toward me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.09,Basic Sign,SIGN; below QR code,0,0,0,,{\c&H7F7D7D&\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&H3E393A&\bord1\frz338.7\move(292,335,327,248,22,397)}REGISTER AS FRIENDS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.09,Basic Sign,SIGN; oval button,0,0,0,,{\c&H7F7D7D&\fnArial\fs12\b0\3c&H3E393A&\bord1\frz338.7\move(282,376,315,286,1,397)}REGENERATE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:29.47,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,as signs of some kind of affection, \Nand it turned my thinking into a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.47,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\frz283.2\move(80,480,30,230,1,437)\c&HE5E7BB&\3c&HBC6B1F&\4c&HBC6B1F&\shad1}HE NOTICED...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:34.02,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,But what if this is all an \Nembarrassing misunderstanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:38.71,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Like, for me this is something that never \Nhappens, but for Yamada-kun it's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:43.92,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? I have so little experience \Nthat I never even thought to question it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:44.73,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.39,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You should say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:50.10,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:53.48,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's just... you were \Nwith other people, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:55.74,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh. You don't want \Nother people to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.84,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.82,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,This is bad. \NMy self-conscious side is showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:02.75,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.12,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Right now, I hate the idea, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:07.27,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:08.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:11.64,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Let's go and talk quietly \Nby ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:20.83,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,All the awful imaginings \Nthat were jumbled up in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:23.11,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,were blown away in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.31,0:08:34.72,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun's words and actions \Nare always so straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.37,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, was this cat around\Nwhen you went by?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:42.14,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:43.17,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:45.98,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! This is Taira, \Nthe guy I was telling you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:48.63,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I've seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:50.27,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And this is Azuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.66,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,A pretty older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.16,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And this bald giant is Morimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:54.12,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Morimo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:54.56,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HAD9C30&\pos(117.6,166.8)\frz18.09}*MORIMOTO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:57.18,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(317,1)\an1\fnArial\fs12\bord1\pos(229.2,188.4)\frz15.91}TAIRA\NOUR TURN FOR THE BATH IS COMING UP
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:56.24,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I've gotta get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:00.69,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:05.69,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:08.86,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Want to go hang out somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,After the class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:15.65,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Like, maybe somewhere we \Nwon't run into anyone from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:16.95,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Anywhere is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.42,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:21.97,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:24.28,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:36.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(601,1)\c&H962D56&\bord1\pos(421,43)}WHY ME...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:35.86,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,When I think about Yamada-kun's feelings, \Nthere's so much I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:36.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(643,1)\c&H962D56&\bord1\an8\pos(230.367,20)}HOW MUCH\NSHOULD I ACCEPT\NAS THE TRUTH?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:36.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(561,1)\c&H962D56&\bord1\pos(584.555,135.445)}REALLY...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:40.40,Flashback,Honda,0,0,0,,I hate people who are evasive about \Ntheir true feelings, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:43.98,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,These feelings of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.72,0:09:47.66,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I can't explain them away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.57,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:58.03,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&HCDFCF9&\3c&H9D71DA&\frz12.68\pos(185.778,40.667)}WHEW...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:58.03,Basic Sign,SIGN; right; ribbon,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1\c&HB06B09&\3c&HF7E6CE&\frz341.9\pos(487.111,112.667)}MEANWHILE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:56.60,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nothing beats my bias.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:02.70,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Back in middle school, \NI couldn't say I didn't want to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.03,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,so I reluctantly went,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:07.57,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,thinking "I want to hurry up and \Ngo home" as I endured my class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:11.55,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.54,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,to be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.81,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I'm having fun. A lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:29.92,Default,yeti,0,0,0,,Class trip, day three!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:32.32,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper right,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H6825A1&\frz338\pos(482.222,133.733)}DAY 3 CLASS ACTIVITIES
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:32.32,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper right; top line,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&H8967B4&\c&HCDFFFF&\frz335.1\pos(549.244,58.089)}TRIP {\c&HE38FF5&}GUI{\c&H3C4FF0&}DE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.68,Default,yeti,0,0,0,,Class activities!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:38.99,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Teacher! Is it okay for me \Nto get some ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:40.19,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,How casual are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.19,0:10:41.50,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.71,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.43,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,I mean, we got around to everything fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:46.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, we had\N left the other classes behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.04,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,As long as you make it back\N before the bus leaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.82,Default,teacher,0,0,0,,you can wander around wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:55.35,Default,class,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:56.62,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:57.67,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Ya—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:00.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.92,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.35,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Stop looking at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:08.24,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,After breaking free of my hometown,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:10.86,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I may accidentally verge \Non getting overly excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:14.66,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,but the moment I see myself \Nlike that, my limiter kicks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:16.97,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Especially when I'm with Azuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:19.62,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&H712044&\3c&HC39CB7&\fs20\fad(563,1)\an1\pos(483.556,171.556)}AZUMA KNOWS\N\h\h\h\h\h\hTHE OLD ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:19.62,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H712044&\3c&HC39CB7&\fs20\fad(563,1)\an7\pos(217.778,47.999)}BACK THEN, I WAS\N\h\h\h\h LOW-LEVEL, THOUGH.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:19.62,Basic Sign,SIGN; far left,0,0,0,,{\c&H712044&\3c&HC39CB7&\fs16\fad(563,1)\an1\pos(197.333,253.333)}I DON'T WANT HER\N\h\h\h\hTHINKING I'M LIVING IT UP\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hIN THIS NEW ENVIRONMENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:18.97,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,All these concerns \Nmix together into...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:22.87,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,An incomplete sense of \Nself-consciousness and inferiority.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:24.72,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:28.63,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Hey, I want to buy some deer senbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.78,Default,Teni,0,0,0,,There's ten in a packet. Shall we share?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:31.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:33.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.54,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.43,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Taira, wanna go halfsies with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:38.37,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:45.65,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs32\fnTrebuchet MS\frz6\pos(311,52)\c&H065A88&\fad(310,1)}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:43.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow! They're already standing by!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:45.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They're used to getting fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,They're really rushing over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wait! This is pretty scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:54.53,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Whoa! Drool! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:56.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Stay! Stay! Time out! Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:57.53,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Stay! Wait! Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:00.76,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Yamada sure is talking \Nto those deer a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Listen to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:05.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Those deer ate everything they could \Neat in a flash and then they all left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.31,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like that's happening there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:09.92,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I don't have any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.35,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Taira's so popular with the deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:16.18,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop laughing and help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:24.59,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:33.15,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs20\pos(299.556,291.334)\c&H9337DB&\3c&HECD6F5&}BUS TOUR STYLE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:33.15,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And now, if I could have your attention \Nfor the return trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:36.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you think we're gonna \Nkeep this party going,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:37.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,throw your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.38,Default,everyone,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:41.58,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Don't give a mid-concert talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:45.59,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In the front row! Tani-kun, \Nhow's your car sickness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:46.58,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs36\c&HBB8FDD&\fnArial\3c&H5A007E&\4c&H5A007E&\shad2\frz12.98\pos(203.555,238.889)\fad(895,1)}TANI
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:49.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Stop sliding personal info into your talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:50.21,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.09,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.35,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:58.18,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H955A4A&\move(70,250,570,250,1,3300)}TANI\N{\fs16}MOVED
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:55.84,Basic Sign,SIGN; left to right,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H955A4A&\move(219,255,719,255)}YAMADA\N{\fs16}HELPING WITH\NTHE TALK
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:56.85,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And now, I'd like to do a quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:58.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H955A4A&\move(-110,250,410,250,1,2500)}SUZUKI\N{\fs16}GIVING THE TALK
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.28,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Here's question 1!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.64,0:13:03.71,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,What two animals are hidden \Nin the Japanese name for April first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:02.85,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I bought lots of snacks, \Nso let's eat some.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.85,Basic Sign,SIGN; back; partially hidden,0,0,0,,{\c&H95D375&\3c&H968783&\pos(296,111.778)\frz354.3}MIXY MIXY
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.85,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\c&H3DCEF0&\3c&H1E359C&\frz29.75\pos(422.223,229.111)}YON YON
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.85,Basic Sign,SIGN; center; sideways,0,0,0,,{\c&H71D6AA&\3c&H7A7281&\pos(240,294.889)\frz68.24}IN NATURE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.85,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H9932DE&\3c&H835DA8&\pos(127.111,157.111)\frz22.03}JIGGLY TAMAPON
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.85,Basic Sign,SIGN; top right,0,0,0,,{\c&H49D2E3&\3c&H228A63&\pos(552.889,47.777)\frz350.5}KOALA'S MARCH
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.27,0:13:04.49,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,That's way too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:08.87,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Those remind me of an elementary school \Nfield trip. So nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.29,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Anyone know the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:10.30,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Then it goes to you, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.87,0:13:10.53,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Nabe recommended them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:11.25,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,No clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:13.37,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Taira? Do you have \Na problem with Nabe-chan's choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:13.19,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Don't say it so enthusiastically!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:17.09,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,The answer is, you take \Nthe "itachi" from "shigatsu tsuitachi,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.73,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I wasn't complaining. Now sit properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:19.24,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! Taira, this is one \Nwhere there's a lucky piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:22.30,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,and since that date is also referred to \Nas "watanuki," the answer is two tanuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:19.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC9336E&\3c&HF8C9D3&\pos(136,110)}RUSSIAN ROULETTE GUM
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:20.54,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I'll give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:22.06,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tell me if you win, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.24,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:26.26,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You didn't understand it at all, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.28,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Wow, that's sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.82,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Your reaction is way too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:31.42,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,And now for question 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:34.00,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Isn't this a normal reaction? \NStop having weird expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.80,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What kind of bird do you get \Nwhen you've got nine all together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:38.58,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Zuma-chan! Having an active \Nparticipant is so helpful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:42.85,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,A nine-ah bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:44.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Incorrect! Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.72,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,And she got it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:49.51,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What? But I was so sure it was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:49.66,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.778,60.667)}That was a tough one. \NThe correct answer is... pigeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.98,0:13:51.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H8C38DA&\pos(422.222,53.111)}PIGEON
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.03,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.778,60.667)}Huh? Why a pigeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:54.07,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.778,60.667)}Pigeon is written with the \Nkanji for "nine" and "bird."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:54.34,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait. Are you weirded out \Nbecause I was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:56.75,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Yamada, can you write \Nthe kanji for pigeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.61,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.92,0:14:00.50,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,It's just... Was Azuma always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.30,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,Pretty much no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.69,Default - Top,Suzuki; background,0,0,0,,Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.12,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Tani, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:09.83,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Dinner tonight is all-you-can-eat!\N Can you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Meat! Meat! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.80,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Don't make him imagine that right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:16.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I want to feel the wind \Nfor a while. Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.26,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.58,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,If you don't know \Nwhere to go, just call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:21.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:25.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And of course, \Nthis is the one time I'm out of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:27.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's all right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:34.20,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What? You're having \Na cola before a buffet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:38.53,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,There's no need to be that shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:44.41,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,No, it's just... I've heard that \Ncola works for car sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.41,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\bord1\an3\move(-24,280,224,280,1,472)}(KNOWLEDGE FROM\NTHE INTERNET)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.51,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That's so kind of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:48.78,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs30\frz14.18\pos(305.778,122.445)\c&H6F1257&\fad(691,1)}OH, MY!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:48.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Stop doing stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, do you usually get car sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, not usually. Just for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.70,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But I'm all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:15:01.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's a relief. Maybe you weren't \Nfeeling well to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:03.58,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We still have tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:04.99,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:08.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In that case, it gets chilly at night, \Nso I'll head back to where everyone—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Stay with me just a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:39.38,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What was that?! \NI regret ever worrying about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:46.32,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That was insane! They're totally living \Nthe springtime of youth! I was shocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:48.67,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I saw something great. \NThat was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:51.47,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It was not good and it was not fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:54.61,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't care anymore. \NI'll drink this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Argh! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:04.65,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wait! I can't! My stomach hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.80,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't laugh at other people's misfortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.87,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,But this is something you laugh at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:19.05,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Somehow, Azuma, you're more...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.11,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,classmate-like than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.64,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.64,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:35.82,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,We always talk casually with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.80,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,And we were in the same class \Ntogether last year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:39.67,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:43.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean... That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.76,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,"You've changed somehow" \Nis what I wanted to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:50.00,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,But what good does saying that do? \NThat's creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:58.41,Basic Sign,SIGN (upper right),0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord1\c&H4E5C84&\3c&HD8FCF9&\frz332.3\pos(465.777,124.223)}MEANWHILE 2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:51.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:51.86,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:53.51,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:52.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:53.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:54.21,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:54.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:55.43,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It was adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:58.41,Basic Sign,SIGN (pink box),0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\c&H7E2EA5&\fs20\3c&HF3E4FD&\pos(133.333,237.111)}FEVERISH
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:55.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.41,Basic Sign,SIGN (blue box),0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\c&HB5A55A&\fs20\3c&HF9FCE3&\pos(497.777,350)}RECOVERED\NA WHILE AGO
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:56.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:57.87,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:58.41,Basic Sign,SIGN (alternating pattern),0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\c&H9A2FEE&\fad(146,193)\pos(116.444,88.667)\frz36.04}BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.93,Default,yeti,0,0,0,,Class trip, the final day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.80,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left,0,0,0,,{\fad(308,1)\fs32\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&H8967B4&\c&HCDFFFF&\an8\pos(141.587,10)}TRIP {\c&HE38FF5&}GUI{\c&H3C4FF0&}DE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:03.04,Default,everyone,0,0,0,,Free time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.80,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper left; top line,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H6825A1&\fad(308,1)\pos(130.222,163.956)}FINAL DAY FREE TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.69,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,Where should we go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:11.29,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,We don't have much time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.82,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Aren't you going somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:14.68,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,That was blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.74,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Well, enjoy your date.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:19.06,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,If we run into you, \Nwe'll pretend we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:21.31,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:25.16,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Couples tend to argue on \Namusement park dates, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:27.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There you go, \Nsaying stuff like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:31.38,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,When a guy has a bad attitude \Nwaiting in lines or driving,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:33.54,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,you should assume \Nthat's their true nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's not from experience, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.78,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Where do you want to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:41.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! There's a spot \NI want to stop by first!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:44.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is it! A popcorn case!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:46.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wanted to wear this \Nand walk around!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:47.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Isn't it adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:49.07,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Adora...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.65,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It seems like your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:57.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to look at the hats \Nand headbands and stuff, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:18:00.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:02.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.70,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, I wasn't expecting that choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:09.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:11.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,seems like you'd wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:14.44,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'd wear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You mean it'd look nice on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:17.43,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:18.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:22.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In that case, which of these \Nwould look good on Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:22.91,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:24.19,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm okay without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:25.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.52,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:31.69,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,That was close! I was getting \Nall excited on my own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:32.87,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If I don't get a grip,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:36.49,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,he'll end up next to an avatar \Nloaded up with paid gacha pulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:42.31,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,But, I was sort of hoping to do casually \Nmatching headbands or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.92,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I guess he's not that type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:45.68,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:48.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Do you want to buy matching ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:51.13,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sort of... like we did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:52.85,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:19:00.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Merch like this is okay, \Nbut headbands are a no-go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:03.96,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's just... I can't imagine myself \Nwearing something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:07.72,Default - Top,Tani,0,0,0,,They look good on you, \Nbut I'd look weird, wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:09.71,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? You wouldn't look weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:13.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Actually, in places like this, \Nyou should be weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You'll regret not going nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:15.97,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.97,0:19:19.31,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's break out of that \Nshell of yours, Yuusuke-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:20.52,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You don't like the idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.79,0:19:24.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's fine! No need to force yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Do you want some? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:32.43,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:41.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,For some reason, it's starting \Nto look cuter and cuter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:43.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So it wasn't cute to you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:58.10,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:05.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Nabe and the others told me not to argue \Nbecause wait times are so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but not having fun is harder, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.02,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(51.556,305.556)\fnTrebuchet MS\shad1\c&HD0B2F4&\3c&H5E0190&\4c&H5E0190&}NEEDLESS\NWORRY\NOF THE\NYEAR
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.08,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:15.11,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But, time-wise, we might not \Nbe able to do anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:16.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:21.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I just got a text from Azu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.19,0:20:24.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It looks like everyone else \Nis together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:27.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I guess we should go and join them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:31.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We have to get ready to \Ngo home already? That's so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:36.84,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.12,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,...chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:46.68,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(69.333,75.333)\c&H53D00D&\fad(231,1)}A BELATED\N"-CHAN"...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:48.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:50.74,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:55.04,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Let's... take the long way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:01.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Y-Yuusuke-kun... hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:06.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Today, you're... \NActually, yesterday, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:08.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, actually, before that, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:11.85,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:16.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I don't know why. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:19.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Maybe I've gone a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:22.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What kind of laugh was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.58,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Boys, that's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.06,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Why are you all wearing those?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.30,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,How'd it start?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.30,0:21:33.05,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,For the looks.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.80,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,The crew members asked \Nabout it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:38.61,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\c&HE05C64&\3c&HF3D6CD&\pos(508.444,345.556)}LARGE GROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:38.61,Default - Top,Taira,0,0,0,,I didn't realize that people \Ngreeted each other that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.61,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\c&H87A80C&\3c&HB1FFC3&\i1\frz30.48\pos(170.667,326)}FRIENDLY
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.12,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(491.556,38.889)\c&H77C90C&\fad(982,1)}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Taira-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:54.00,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What? Why are you only \Ngiving me that reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:54.88,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(472,32.667)\fad(932,1)\c&H85DD15&}YOU'RE WEARING ONE...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.25,0:21:57.90,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey! Let's all take \Na group picture together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.90,Default,everyone,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:05.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you thinking you should've \Njust gone all the way insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:06.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:08.28,Default,crew member,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm taking it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.34,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:11.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:12.27,Default - Top,crew member,0,0,0,,Say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:14.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We'll have to come back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.31,0:22:16.13,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
